{
 "_": [
  "g13w3-f-authority (standing stand-in), part one of three, on throwaway peers a and b:",
  "a (owner) makes the server with a voice room, b joins and they talk. Then the runner stops a",
  "(-Stop -Peers a) and runs part two (g13w3_standing_b) with b and c while the owner is away;",
  "part three (g13w3_standing_c) brings a back and deletes the server. No cleanup here: the",
  "server must survive into part two."
 ],
